{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ואבואה אל מזבח אלהים</b> [—] <b>אל</b> — that it is the joy of my gladness." "And the sense of <b>אלהים אלהי</b> — that an unholy nation may fear, that You are my Elohim."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:39.564676429Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}